OL,16,     FAnthony Gordon and Morgan Rogers
OL,17,     Fsubjecting the Croatians to their
OL,18,     Fheaviest ever defeat. England are
OL,19,     Fall but certain of a place in the
OL,20,     Fquarter-finals, but their
OL,21,     Fopponents will be determined to
OL,22,     Frestore some pride this evening
